<Folder><name>Day 1</name>
<Placemark><name>1. Dublin Airport</name><styleUrl>#day1</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Airport</b><br/>Arrival, hire-car collection and starting point.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Car hire dependent<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> Allow 45-75 min<br/><b>Booking:</b> Check rental desk and shuttle details<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Dublin Airport, Ireland]]></description><Point><coordinates>-6.2499,53.4264,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>2. Malahide Castle &amp; Gardens</name><styleUrl>#day1</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Castle</b><br/>An 800-year-old castle estate with guided castle visits, gardens and parkland.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Check current ticket type<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 60-90 min<br/><b>Booking:</b> Useful rather than essential<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Malahide Castle and Gardens, Back Road, Malahide, Co. Dublin]]></description><Point><coordinates>-6.1642,53.4448,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>3. Brú na Bóinne Visitor Centre / Newgrange</name><styleUrl>#day1</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Ancient site</b><br/>UNESCO World Heritage landscape containing Newgrange, Knowth and Dowth. Tours depart from the visitor centre; do not drive directly to Newgrange.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Check official booking page<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 2-2.5 hrs<br/><b>Booking:</b> Essential - September tickets normally released 30 days ahead<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Brú na Bóinne Visitor Centre, Donore, Co. Meath, A92 EH5C]]></description><Point><coordinates>-6.4463,53.6947,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>4. Monasterboice High Crosses</name><styleUrl>#day1</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Monastic site</b><br/>Early Christian monastic ruins noted for Muiredach's High Cross and a round tower.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Free<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 30-40 min<br/><b>Booking:</b> No<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Monasterboice, Co. Louth, Ireland]]></description><Point><coordinates>-6.4174,53.7778,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>5. Carlingford</name><styleUrl>#day1</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Town / viewpoint</b><br/>Medieval coastal village beneath the Cooley Mountains, overlooking Carlingford Lough.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Free to explore<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 60-90 min<br/><b>Booking:</b> No<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Carlingford, Co. Louth, Ireland]]></description><Point><coordinates>-6.1867,54.0407,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>6. Ballymascanlon Hotel</name><styleUrl>#day1</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Accommodation</b><br/>Overnight accommodation.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Booked separately<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> -<br/><b>Booking:</b> Confirm parking and check-in<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Ballymascanlon Hotel and Golf Resort, Dundalk, Co. Louth]]></description><Point><coordinates>-6.3433,54.0425,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Day 1 overview line (not road-following)</name><styleUrl>#day1</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-6.2499,53.4264,0 -6.1642,53.4448,0 -6.4463,53.6947,0 -6.4174,53.7778,0 -6.1867,54.0407,0 -6.3433,54.0425,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
</Folder>
<Folder><name>Day 2</name>
<Placemark><name>1. Ballymascanlon Hotel</name><styleUrl>#day2</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Accommodation</b><br/>Day-two departure point.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> -<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> -<br/><b>Booking:</b> -<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Ballymascanlon Hotel and Golf Resort, Dundalk, Co. Louth]]></description><Point><coordinates>-6.3433,54.0425,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>2. Clonmacnoise Monastic Site</name><styleUrl>#day2</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Monastic site</b><br/>Major early Christian settlement on the River Shannon with ruined churches, round towers and high crosses. The visitor centre has recently been affected by essential works, so recheck before travelling.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Adult listed at €8 when fully operating<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 75-105 min<br/><b>Booking:</b> Recheck visitor-centre status<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Clonmacnoise Monastic Site, Shannonbridge, Co. Offaly]]></description><Point><coordinates>-7.9861,53.3263,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>3. Athlone Castle</name><styleUrl>#day2</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Castle / town</b><br/>A compact riverside castle and museum beside the historic Shannon crossing; easy to combine with lunch.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Check current admission<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 45-60 min optional<br/><b>Booking:</b> Usually not essential<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Athlone Castle Visitor Centre, Castle Street, Athlone]]></description><Point><coordinates>-7.942,53.4235,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>4. The Sliding Rock Inn</name><styleUrl>#day2</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Accommodation</b><br/>Galway accommodation for two nights.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Booked separately<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> -<br/><b>Booking:</b> Confirm parking<br/><b>Address/query:</b> The Sliding Rock Inn, Newcastle Road, Galway]]></description><Point><coordinates>-9.0612,53.2737,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>5. Galway Latin Quarter</name><styleUrl>#day2</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>City walk</b><br/>Pedestrian-friendly historic centre around Shop Street, Quay Street and the Spanish Arch.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Free<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 2 hrs to evening<br/><b>Booking:</b> Reserve dinner only if preferred<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Latin Quarter, Galway, Ireland]]></description><Point><coordinates>-9.0555,53.271,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Day 2 overview line (not road-following)</name><styleUrl>#day2</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-6.3433,54.0425,0 -7.9861,53.3263,0 -7.942,53.4235,0 -9.0612,53.2737,0 -9.0555,53.271,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
</Folder>
<Folder><name>Day 3</name>
<Placemark><name>1. The Sliding Rock Inn</name><styleUrl>#day3</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Accommodation</b><br/>Start and finish of the Connemara loop.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> -<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> -<br/><b>Booking:</b> -<br/><b>Address/query:</b> The Sliding Rock Inn, Newcastle Road, Galway]]></description><Point><coordinates>-9.0612,53.2737,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>2. Oughterard</name><styleUrl>#day3</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Town / coffee</b><br/>Small gateway town on the shores of Lough Corrib; planned coffee break.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Food/drink only<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 20 min<br/><b>Booking:</b> No<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Oughterard, Co. Galway, Ireland]]></description><Point><coordinates>-9.323,53.428,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>3. Connemara National Park Visitor Centre</name><styleUrl>#day3</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>National park</b><br/>Free national park with trails ranging from short lower walks to the steeper Diamond Hill circuit.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Free<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 1.5-3 hrs<br/><b>Booking:</b> No; weather dependent<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Connemara National Park Visitor Centre, Letterfrack, Co. Galway]]></description><Point><coordinates>-9.9486,53.5538,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>4. Kylemore Abbey &amp; Victorian Walled Garden</name><styleUrl>#day3</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Abbey / garden</b><br/>Victorian lakeside castle, Benedictine abbey, neo-Gothic church and restored walled garden.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Check current online rate<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 2-3 hrs<br/><b>Booking:</b> Recommended<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Kylemore Abbey, Connemara, Co. Galway, H91 VR90]]></description><Point><coordinates>-9.8899,53.5618,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>5. Clifden</name><styleUrl>#day3</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Town</b><br/>Colourful market town often described as the capital of Connemara.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Free to explore<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 45-60 min<br/><b>Booking:</b> No<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Clifden, Co. Galway, Ireland]]></description><Point><coordinates>-10.019,53.4889,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>6. Sky Road Upper Viewpoint</name><styleUrl>#day3</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Viewpoint</b><br/>High-level viewpoint across the Atlantic islands and the Connemara coast.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Free<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 20-40 min<br/><b>Booking:</b> No<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Sky Road Wild Atlantic View Point, Clifden, Co. Galway]]></description><Point><coordinates>-10.0979,53.5082,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>7. The Sliding Rock Inn</name><styleUrl>#day3</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Accommodation</b><br/>Return to Galway.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> -<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> -<br/><b>Booking:</b> -<br/><b>Address/query:</b> The Sliding Rock Inn, Newcastle Road, Galway]]></description><Point><coordinates>-9.0612,53.2737,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
