</Folder>
<Folder><name>Day 4</name>
<Placemark><name>1. The Sliding Rock Inn</name><styleUrl>#day4</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Accommodation</b><br/>Departure point.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> -<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> -<br/><b>Booking:</b> -<br/><b>Address/query:</b> The Sliding Rock Inn, Newcastle Road, Galway]]></description><Point><coordinates>-9.0612,53.2737,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>2. Cliffs of Moher Experience</name><styleUrl>#day4</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Cliffs / visitor centre</b><br/>Ireland's best-known sea cliffs, with paved viewing areas, exhibition and parking included in the visitor-experience ticket.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Dynamic/time-based; check online<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 2-2.5 hrs<br/><b>Booking:</b> Recommended; September hours listed as 08:00-19:00<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Cliffs of Moher Experience, Liscannor, Co. Clare, V95 KN9T]]></description><Point><coordinates>-9.4265,52.9719,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>3. Doolin</name><styleUrl>#day4</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Village / lunch</b><br/>Small coastal village known for traditional music and ferries to the Aran Islands.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Free to explore<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 60 min<br/><b>Booking:</b> Lunch booking optional<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Doolin, Co. Clare, Ireland]]></description><Point><coordinates>-9.3774,53.0151,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>4. Poulnabrone Dolmen</name><styleUrl>#day4</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Ancient site</b><br/>Neolithic portal tomb set within the limestone pavement of the Burren; a useful short scenic stop.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Free<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 20-30 min<br/><b>Booking:</b> No<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Poulnabrone Dolmen, Co. Clare, Ireland]]></description><Point><coordinates>-9.1405,53.0486,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>5. Adare</name><styleUrl>#day4</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Village</b><br/>Historic village known for thatched cottages, stone buildings and riverside remains.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Free to explore<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 45-60 min<br/><b>Booking:</b> No<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Adare, Co. Limerick, Ireland]]></description><Point><coordinates>-8.7907,52.564,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>6. Foley's Townhouse, Killarney</name><styleUrl>#day4</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Accommodation</b><br/>Killarney accommodation for two nights.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Booked separately<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> -<br/><b>Booking:</b> Confirm parking arrangements<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Foley's Townhouse, High Street, Killarney, Co. Kerry]]></description><Point><coordinates>-9.507,52.0598,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
