</Folder>
<Folder><name>Day 5</name>
<Placemark><name>1. Foley's Townhouse, Killarney</name><styleUrl>#day5</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Accommodation</b><br/>Start and finish of the Ring of Kerry day.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> -<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> -<br/><b>Booking:</b> -<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Foley's Townhouse, High Street, Killarney, Co. Kerry]]></description><Point><coordinates>-9.507,52.0598,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>2. Ladies View</name><styleUrl>#day5</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Viewpoint</b><br/>Classic elevated view across the Lakes of Killarney.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Free<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 15-25 min<br/><b>Booking:</b> No<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Ladies View, Killarney National Park, Co. Kerry]]></description><Point><coordinates>-9.5903,51.9685,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>3. Moll's Gap</name><styleUrl>#day5</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Mountain pass</b><br/>Mountain pass with views over the MacGillycuddy's Reeks and surrounding valleys.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Free<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 15-25 min<br/><b>Booking:</b> No<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Moll's Gap, Co. Kerry, Ireland]]></description><Point><coordinates>-9.6552,51.9389,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>4. Kenmare</name><styleUrl>#day5</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Town</b><br/>Attractive heritage town at the head of Kenmare Bay.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Free to explore<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 45-60 min<br/><b>Booking:</b> No<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Kenmare, Co. Kerry, Ireland]]></description><Point><coordinates>-9.583,51.88,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>5. Sneem</name><styleUrl>#day5</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Village</b><br/>Colourful village split by the River Sneem, with small squares and riverside walks.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Free<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 30-45 min<br/><b>Booking:</b> No<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Sneem, Co. Kerry, Ireland]]></description><Point><coordinates>-9.8983,51.8377,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>6. Waterville</name><styleUrl>#day5</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Coastal stop</b><br/>Atlantic-facing village on the Iveragh Peninsula, suitable for lunch and a seafront walk.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Free to explore<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 60 min<br/><b>Booking:</b> Lunch booking optional<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Waterville, Co. Kerry, Ireland]]></description><Point><coordinates>-10.1716,51.8288,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>7. Derrynane Beach</name><styleUrl>#day5</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Beach / viewpoint</b><br/>Sheltered sandy beach and coastal landscape near Derrynane National Historic Park.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Free; parking may apply<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 30-60 min<br/><b>Booking:</b> No<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Derrynane Beach, Caherdaniel, Co. Kerry]]></description><Point><coordinates>-10.1283,51.7695,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>8. Cahersiveen</name><styleUrl>#day5</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Town / viewpoint</b><br/>Optional west-coast stop and gateway to Skellig Coast viewpoints.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Free<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 20-40 min<br/><b>Booking:</b> No<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Cahersiveen, Co. Kerry, Ireland]]></description><Point><coordinates>-10.2229,51.9488,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>9. Foley's Townhouse, Killarney</name><styleUrl>#day5</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Accommodation</b><br/>Return to Killarney.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> -<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> -<br/><b>Booking:</b> -<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Foley's Townhouse, High Street, Killarney, Co. Kerry]]></description><Point><coordinates>-9.507,52.0598,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
