<Folder><name>Day 6</name>
<Placemark><name>1. Foley's Townhouse, Killarney</name><styleUrl>#day6</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Accommodation</b><br/>Departure point.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> -<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> -<br/><b>Booking:</b> -<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Foley's Townhouse, High Street, Killarney, Co. Kerry]]></description><Point><coordinates>-9.507,52.0598,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>2. Rock of Cashel</name><styleUrl>#day6</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Medieval site</b><br/>Hilltop medieval complex containing a round tower, Gothic cathedral and Cormac's Chapel.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Adult €8; family €20 listed<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 1-1.5 hrs<br/><b>Booking:</b> Check Cormac's Chapel tour availability<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Rock of Cashel, St Patrick's Rock, Cashel, Co. Tipperary, E25 KX44]]></description><Point><coordinates>-7.8905,52.5201,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>3. Cahir Castle</name><styleUrl>#day6</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Castle</b><br/>Large, well-preserved medieval castle occupying a rocky island in the River Suir.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Check official rate<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 60-75 min<br/><b>Booking:</b> Usually not essential<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Cahir Castle, Castle Street, Cahir, Co. Tipperary, E21 P652]]></description><Point><coordinates>-7.9256,52.3758,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>4. JB's Bar &amp; Guest House</name><styleUrl>#day6</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Accommodation</b><br/>Kilkenny accommodation.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Booked separately<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> -<br/><b>Booking:</b> Confirm parking<br/><b>Address/query:</b> JB's Bar and Guesthouse, Kilkenny, Ireland]]></description><Point><coordinates>-7.2523,52.6545,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>5. Kilkenny Castle</name><styleUrl>#day6</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Castle</b><br/>Former Butler family residence overlooking the River Nore; the extensive park is free.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Check current castle admission; park free<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 60-90 min<br/><b>Booking:</b> Optional online booking<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Kilkenny Castle, The Parade, Kilkenny, R95 YRK1]]></description><Point><coordinates>-7.2494,52.6506,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>6. Medieval Mile</name><styleUrl>#day6</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>City walk</b><br/>Walkable historic spine linking Kilkenny Castle with St Canice's Cathedral.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Free to walk<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 1-2 hrs<br/><b>Booking:</b> No<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Medieval Mile, Kilkenny, Ireland]]></description><Point><coordinates>-7.2524,52.6534,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>7. Kyteler's Inn</name><styleUrl>#day6</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Pub / history</b><br/>Historic inn associated with the 14th-century trial of Alice Kyteler; suggested evening venue.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Food/drink only<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> Evening<br/><b>Booking:</b> Dinner booking advisable<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Kyteler's Inn, St Kieran's Street, Kilkenny]]></description><Point><coordinates>-7.253,52.6532,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
