<Placemark><name>3. Glendalough Monastic Site</name><styleUrl>#day7</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>Monastic site / lakes</b><br/>Early medieval monastic settlement in a glacial valley, with round tower, churches and lakeside walks.<br/><b>Indicative cost:</b> Open monastic site free; visitor centre/parking may charge<br/><b>Suggested time:</b> 1.5-2.5 hrs<br/><b>Booking:</b> Optional; allow weekend parking time<br/><b>Address/query:</b> Glendalough Monastic Site and Visitor Centre, Co. Wicklow, A98 HC80]]></description><Point><coordinates>-6.3273,53.0104,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
